            The best caulk for concrete starts with the joint. Flat joints get a self-leveling polyurethane or hybrid such as Sikaflex Self-Leveling or Quikrete Advanced Polymer; vertical cracks and steps get a non-sag polyurethane such as Loctite PL Concrete or Sikaflex + Construction Sealant; hairline cosmetic cracks get Sashco Slab.
